sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant TransactionInvoiceController
    participant TransactionInvoiceService
    participant AccountCategoryRepository
    participant Database

    Client->>+TransactionInvoiceController: POST /api/v1/transaction-invoices/batch
    TransactionInvoiceController->>TransactionInvoiceController: Validate cashInOutId not empty
    TransactionInvoiceController->>TransactionInvoiceController: Validate accountCategoryIds not empty
    TransactionInvoiceController->>+TransactionInvoiceService: CreateBatchAsync(dto)
    loop For each accountCategoryId
        TransactionInvoiceService->>+AccountCategoryRepository: GetByIdAsync(accountCategoryId)
        AccountCategoryRepository-->>-TransactionInvoiceService: AccountCategory entity
        TransactionInvoiceService->>+Database: INSERT TransactionInvoice
        Database-->>-TransactionInvoiceService: invoiceId
    end
    TransactionInvoiceService-->>-TransactionInvoiceController: BatchTransactionInvoiceResultDto
    TransactionInvoiceController-->>-Client: 201 Created { successCount, failureCount, failedAccountCategories }
